Description: TROLL simulates every tree of a tropical forest stand on a 1 m
    resolution 3D grid and jointly tracks forest structure, carbon and water
    fluxes and species-level biodiversity. This file only configures the
    website, built with pkgdown: TROLL itself is a C++ program.
